# <type>: <description>
#
# type:
#   feat     add a feature
#   fix      fix a bug
#   test     add or update tests
#   docs     update README or specs
#   refactor change code without changing behavior
#   chore    other maintenance
#
# description:
#   - English, imperative mood (add / fix / update)
#   - start with a lowercase letter
#   - no trailing period
#   - within 72 characters
#
# e.g. feat: add reservation usecase
#      fix: return 404 for draft slots
#      docs: add progress to README